WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.320
Hi, I'm Fred Noseit, the keeper of AIEDUMe, and your 9 to 12 teacher helper.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.620
Ask me anything, and I'll find it for you, or send you to the right helper.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:14.200
Ideas, lessons, websites, and things to make for high school.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.280
Tap any tile, and I'll tell you what it is, and how to use it.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.380
Then tap go there, or ask me to help you make a lesson.
